==Phonology==
There is no consensus on the pronunciation of the syllables distinguished by {{tlit|ja|man'yōgana}}.{{sfn|Miyake|2003|p=2}}
One difficulty is that the [[Middle Chinese]] pronunciations of the characters used are also disputed, and since the reconstruction of their phonetic values is partly based on later [[Sino-Japanese vocabulary|Sino-Japanese]] pronunciations, there is a danger of [[circular reasoning]].{{sfn|Miyake|2003|pp=54–55, 63–64}}
Additional evidence has been drawn from phonological [[linguistic typology|typology]], subsequent developments in the Japanese pronunciation, and the comparative study of the [[Ryukyuan languages]].{{sfn|Miyake|2003|pp=64–65}}

